  "description": "Addition of a new lower ground floor (basement) extension with associated front and rear lightwells. Refurbishment and alteration of the existing ground floor rear extension, incorporating the footprint of the demolished central courtyard, with the addition of a new rooflight and internal staircase connecting to the existing raised ground floor living area. Installation of one painted timber French door set to the front lightwell and one painted timber sash window. At the rear, removal of the existing ground floor fenestration and enlargement of the opening to accommodate new aluminium-framed sliding doors. Introduction of a matching sliding door at the lower ground floor rear elevation. The proposal also includes a new internal layout throughout.",
